      ],
      "score": 429,
      "summary_zh": "PropertyType 是 OPC UA 10000-5 信息模型中的 VariableType 实体，定义位置为第 7.3 节，关联表格 Table 73。",
      "summary_en": "The PropertyType is a subtype of the BaseVariableType. It is used as the type definition for all Properties. Properties are defined by their BrowseName and therefore they do not need a specialised type definition. It is not allowed to subtype this VariableType."
    },
